"""SEN0401 Ch7/Ch8: speech-balloon sentences for the concept-card slides.
CARDS7[slide] / CARDS8[slide] = one (sentence 1, sentence 2) pair per card, in reading order of the cards on the slide
(left to right, top to bottom). The card's own term is read from the slide. One sentence per balloon; **word** marks the key words.
EXTRA7 / EXTRA8 = one further paragraph of detail for the reader notes of the slide (what the balloons do not say)."""

